# Permuto .gitignore
#
# NOTE on build/: this repo has the OLD build/ tree committed (130 of its 163 tracked
# files are build artifacts). build/ is deliberately NOT listed here as a directory
# ignore: ignoring a directory that is still tracked makes git report "tracked files
# matched by .gitignore" and hides the problem instead of showing it. The fix is
# `git rm -r --cached build/` plus a commit, and that is a decision for the repo owner.
#
# Until then the gate builds in build-ci/ (see the adaptation notes at the top of
# tools/ci.sh) and the `tree` stage stays out of the gate's stage list — run
# `tools/ci.sh tree` to see the honest report, including which of those tracked files
# the patterns below would ignore.

# --- the gate's own footprint (tools/ci.sh) ---
build-ci/
build-ci-*/
.ci-logs/
.ci.env

# --- build output ---
out/
build-*/
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.exe

# --- CMake droppings ---
CMakeFiles/
CMakeCache.txt
cmake_install.cmake
compile_commands.json
CMakeUserPresets.json

# --- editor / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.cache/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- coverage ---
*.gcov
*.gcda
*.gcno
coverage/
